Cats 'Round the World!

The Battle Cats has been growing and growing since it's release almost 3 years ago! Now we've reached 30,000,000 downloads, and the weirdly cute felines are being enjoyed by players from all over!

To celebrate our global community, we're highlighting six YouTubers in different languages enjoying our game!

①MattShea (English): https://youtu.be/GsndcYMtiow<br>
②ConCrafter (German): https://youtu.be/TJTJ0Jxz3ko<br>
③zbing z (Thai): https://youtu.be/UKz8Sd3Cwpc<br>
④WhaTheGame (Spanish): https://youtu.be/3L68xbHK7QA<br>
⑤FavijTV (Italian): https://youtu.be/pdOyAwWgNWA<br>
⑥Aiekillu (French): https://youtu.be/X_7aTP0pA_8

Check out these videos on posts with the #CatsRoundTheWorld hashtag and YOU can help earn all Battle Cats players cool rewards!!

If you can help us reach 2,000,000 total views between all 6 videos we'll be posting this week, a mystery map will be unlocked after the campaign ends with a limited-edition Cat reward! There may be other prizes as well...

Thanks for playing, and enjoy the videos!

