★★ CATS ROUND THE WORLD: VICTORY!!! ★★<br>
Rewards on August 6th, 12th, and 16th!

Total views between campaign videos not only reached the 2,000,000 goal, but beat that by almost 1,000,000 extra views! As thanks, we're adding two Rare Tickets to the campaign rewards!

First, log in to The Battle Cats on August 6th to pick up one free Rare Ticket, then again on August 12th to get one more!<br>
Finally, head to Stories of Legend/Event Stages on 8/16 to pick up Squishball Cat from the "Watch and Earn" special stage!

Thanks again, and look forward to more fun campaigns appearing soon!

